# The #5239 fail-closed half lost: an envelope the decoder cannot serve is trusted.
MODULE: StoredValidWhenJudgedUndecodableTrusted
TARGET: StoredValidWhenJudged
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an undecodable enveloped entry is admitted
PERTURBS: Judge

--- FIND
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], seen) THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- REPLACE
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], seen) /\ val[cur].tag # "Orphan" THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- END